WEBVTT

00:00:24.859 --> 00:00:27.111
The White Legacy...

00:00:27.195 --> 00:00:33.784
<i>No matter what might await us there</i>

00:00:34.035 --> 00:00:42.460
<i>I'll go to unexplored territory with you</i>

00:00:50.718 --> 00:00:58.768
<i>I just had a short dream</i>

00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:03.397
<i>In it, I saw your back</i>

00:01:03.648 --> 00:01:09.570
<i>Was it the past? The future?</i>

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:20.331
<i>Ignore the needle on that meter
pointing to the red zone</i>

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:23.459
<i>And go where the tailwinds
and your feelings point you</i>

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:29.632
<i>Every time I flap my wings, it makes me realize</i>

00:01:29.882 --> 00:01:35.179
<i>That there are skies
I'll never be able to see again</i>

00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:40.685
<i>But if you still want to take flight</i>

00:01:40.935 --> 00:01:47.483
<i>Then I will be your wings</i>

00:02:06.627 --> 00:02:09.630
Get moving! You enemies of the people!

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.383
These traitors forsook their
homelands for personal gain

00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:16.971
and attempted to hinder our sacred crusade.

00:02:17.221 --> 00:02:19.098
Who knows just how many
seeds could have been planted

00:02:19.348 --> 00:02:23.978
with the money these people
so greedily leeched from others?

00:02:24.228 --> 00:02:28.607
However, they have been punished
in a manner befitting their crimes.

00:02:28.858 --> 00:02:33.696
Now the world shall recognize our resolve.

00:02:33.946 --> 00:02:36.073
A clear path lies before us.

00:02:36.324 --> 00:02:40.619
All of this world's land shall be ours once more.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:46.292
Our forces will push forward, beyond the
northern reaches of the sacred Grand Lake...

00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:52.089
...to your old homeland of Glacies,
which is now occupied by returnees!

00:02:54.675 --> 00:02:57.386
My people! Let us return together!

00:02:57.636 --> 00:03:00.181
Gloria, Augusta!

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.061
That was a magnificent address.

00:03:05.311 --> 00:03:08.856
You must be exhausted.
Perhaps you should rest--

00:03:10.316 --> 00:03:13.027
They're all dead...

00:03:13.277 --> 00:03:15.738
All because of me...

00:03:15.988 --> 00:03:17.490
Augusta...?!

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:23.788
It's because I'm a child... because
I'm unreliable... that they're...!

00:03:24.038 --> 00:03:28.334
That isn't true! Your Majesty
is not at fault in the least!

00:03:28.584 --> 00:03:30.669
Their greed was their undoing...

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.339
I was supposed to protect the people!

00:03:33.589 --> 00:03:36.008
I was supposed to have their trust!

00:03:36.258 --> 00:03:38.135
Like Mother did...!

00:03:44.016 --> 00:03:47.770
I'm so sorry... I'm so sorry...

00:03:51.399 --> 00:03:58.531
You have me, Your Majesty. I <i>will</i>
help you achieve your aspirations.

00:04:05.621 --> 00:04:08.040
We've stamped out most of
the resistance movements.

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.835
Collection of capital has also
begun in territories owned

00:04:11.085 --> 00:04:12.920
by noblemen who have surrendered.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:14.088
Good work.

00:04:14.338 --> 00:04:19.051
We owe this success to the swift
advance of "Ades' Almighty Spear."

00:04:19.301 --> 00:04:20.970
You're too kind.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:23.681
My hindward fears have been put to rest.

00:04:23.931 --> 00:04:27.935
My last remaining worry
will soon be resolved as well.

00:04:28.185 --> 00:04:30.896
At last we'll be able to move forward.

00:04:31.147 --> 00:04:34.733
The Grand Lake's southern coast will
soon be under our complete control.

00:04:34.984 --> 00:04:36.819
We will now take the battle northward

00:04:37.069 --> 00:04:40.990
and begin full-scale efforts to reclaim
the Grand Lake's northern coast.

00:04:42.032 --> 00:04:44.326
Kumari, Arshii, Sepehr...

00:04:44.577 --> 00:04:48.330
The small nations in this area
should yield easily enough.

00:04:48.581 --> 00:04:51.041
Vasant's negotiations are also proving effective.

00:04:51.292 --> 00:04:54.378
It looks like our greatest
obstacle will indeed be...

00:04:54.628 --> 00:04:56.213
...Glacies.

00:04:57.298 --> 00:04:58.466
We can safely assume that the Federation

00:04:58.716 --> 00:05:02.094
will now turn its attention
north of the Grand Lake.

00:05:02.344 --> 00:05:06.432
And when it does, it'll run
smack dab into Glacies.

00:05:07.766 --> 00:05:09.852
Will it be a head-on confrontation?

00:05:10.102 --> 00:05:11.395
Most likely.

00:05:11.645 --> 00:05:15.232
Glacies has practiced total
independence ever since it was founded.

00:05:15.483 --> 00:05:18.777
They probably don't even bat an eye
as the Federation usurps other lands,

00:05:19.028 --> 00:05:22.948
but it'll be a completely different story
once their territory is threatened.

00:05:24.241 --> 00:05:27.786
In a way, they're even
worse than the Federation.

00:05:28.037 --> 00:05:30.247
They refuse any and all negotiations

00:05:30.498 --> 00:05:33.375
and will attack the instant someone
steps foot in their territory.

00:05:33.626 --> 00:05:38.297
They don't hold to the idea that
your enemy's enemy is your friend.

00:05:40.591 --> 00:05:44.845
The action they take will determine our future.

00:05:45.095 --> 00:05:50.059
I guess all we can do is trust
in Vincent's bargaining ability...

00:05:50.309 --> 00:05:52.686
Perhaps we should do some early research.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.276
Lay in a new course for the Glacies border.

00:06:01.779 --> 00:06:03.739
Teddy taught me.

00:06:03.989 --> 00:06:08.410
Pests and germs are always lookin'
to infiltrate your territory.

00:06:08.661 --> 00:06:09.954
Stay sharp!

00:06:10.204 --> 00:06:11.789
Y-Yes, Sir!

00:06:12.873 --> 00:06:15.668
But this is the perfect chance!

00:06:15.918 --> 00:06:18.379
Mind your manners, Fam.

00:06:21.632 --> 00:06:26.428
It's true that these purges are
gonna make Ades even stronger.

00:06:26.679 --> 00:06:31.684
But it's times like this when huge
opportunities show themselves!

00:06:33.102 --> 00:06:37.648
Battleships belonging to the
territories of purged nobles

00:06:37.898 --> 00:06:40.025
are being taken back to the Ades Federation.

00:06:40.276 --> 00:06:42.236
The most noteworthy of which

00:06:42.486 --> 00:06:45.698
is that fleet being transported
from the northern land of Fields.

00:06:45.948 --> 00:06:50.202
It consists of eight brand-new ships,
constructed only six months ago.

00:06:50.452 --> 00:06:54.873
Eight ships? But our agreement
only calls for one more.

00:06:55.124 --> 00:06:57.293
Yes. But Fam feels that...

00:06:57.543 --> 00:06:59.878
I think we should go all out for this last one!

00:07:00.129 --> 00:07:02.590
Just imagine the look on the captain's face

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.384
when we bring her eight ships all at once!

00:07:05.634 --> 00:07:07.678
Yes, that would be quite a sight!

00:07:07.928 --> 00:07:09.096
Not you too...!

00:07:09.346 --> 00:07:14.143
Right?! So let's show her what we're made of!

00:07:19.523 --> 00:07:21.442
Thank you very much.

00:07:21.692 --> 00:07:24.028
You finished it already?

00:07:24.278 --> 00:07:25.112
Yes.

00:07:25.362 --> 00:07:30.868
Even "A Summary of Signal Lights and
Flares Per the Trans-Grand Lake Treaty"?

00:07:31.118 --> 00:07:34.288
Yes. It was most informative.

00:07:34.538 --> 00:07:37.458
It sounds like you don't
need my guidance anymore.

00:07:37.708 --> 00:07:41.462
At this point, you can delve into
whatever subjects pique your interest.

00:07:41.712 --> 00:07:46.508
Umm, now could you
possibly tell me your strategy

00:07:46.759 --> 00:07:48.719
for single-handedly destroying an Ades fleet?

00:07:49.928 --> 00:07:52.222
I told you, there's no such thing.

00:07:52.473 --> 00:07:55.851
Fighting all boils down to resources.

00:07:58.604 --> 00:08:00.147
Giselle.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.860
Information for your mission?

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:08.155
Yes. I'm still uneasy about some things...

00:08:08.405 --> 00:08:12.076
You're really something. Fam could
learn a thing or two from you.

00:08:12.326 --> 00:08:15.245
Fam is... fine as she is.

00:08:15.496 --> 00:08:20.209
This is my job, as her navi.

00:08:20.459 --> 00:08:22.628
We can't afford to fail this time.

00:08:22.878 --> 00:08:25.714
Ades is going to get tougher and tougher now.

00:08:25.964 --> 00:08:29.843
It won't be easy to hunt Sky-Fish anymore.

00:08:35.015 --> 00:08:39.269
Giselle. Please help me for just a little longer.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:44.400
<i>I will</i> put Pam's fleet to
good use and reclaim Turan.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:48.028
I'll also make the dream you share come true.

00:08:59.373 --> 00:09:00.791
Grand Birds!

00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:02.459
What's that? You wanna race?!

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:07.297
All right, you're on! Let the
Grand Race qualifiers begin!

00:09:12.136 --> 00:09:13.053
Fam...

00:09:13.303 --> 00:09:14.847
Yeah?

00:09:15.097 --> 00:09:18.058
Today we'll have gathered
fifteen ships, like we agreed.

00:09:18.308 --> 00:09:21.854
--Have you thought about after that?
--After?

00:09:22.104 --> 00:09:25.190
We won't need to stay on the Silvius anymore.

00:09:25.441 --> 00:09:27.860
We can go back to Kartoffel.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:30.487
I'm worried about Adele and René.

00:09:30.738 --> 00:09:33.949
Félicité isn't ready to help Mom yet,

00:09:34.199 --> 00:09:38.036
and Dad's helpless when he's not in the sky.

00:09:38.287 --> 00:09:41.582
Besides, don't you miss
Fritz and the others too?

00:09:41.832 --> 00:09:43.834
<i>Haw' YQ“ n“ 3's um'</i>

00:09:44.084 --> 00:09:46.170
Fan'!

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:48.046
Fritz! Heine!

00:09:48.297 --> 00:09:49.590
Johann, too!

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.675
So you are okay!

00:09:51.925 --> 00:09:56.472
Can't believe you managed to escape
the infamous Silvius, Birdbrain!

00:09:56.722 --> 00:09:58.849
Atamora's pissed, you know!

00:10:08.108 --> 00:10:09.735
Dad...!

00:10:12.404 --> 00:10:15.491
Atamora. You can finally rest easy now.

00:10:16.867 --> 00:10:20.287
Uhh... Are you guys here for us?

00:10:20.537 --> 00:10:25.876
Heck, no! We're here for Skyfish!
Some huge ones are headed this way!

00:10:26.126 --> 00:10:27.920
The battleships Ades is transporting...!

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:32.382
So you're after 'em, too?
It's gonna be a fierce battle, though!

00:10:36.178 --> 00:10:41.892
Zwiebel, Pilze, Karotten,
Kiirbis, and even Spargel?!

00:10:44.228 --> 00:10:46.230
Uh oh! They're a-comin'!

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:49.399
No! They're our prey!

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:51.985
Butt out, Birdbrain!

00:10:52.236 --> 00:10:54.279
Good tailwinds!

00:10:56.365 --> 00:10:59.201
Fam! Keep an eye out for currents
blowing into the canyon!

00:10:59.451 --> 00:11:01.161
R°gefl

00:11:07.709 --> 00:11:11.088
<i>Skyfish! My Skyfish!</i>

00:11:35.863 --> 00:11:38.615
The best position! Good going, Gisey!

00:11:40.534 --> 00:11:42.703
The first harpoon is mine!

00:11:56.675 --> 00:11:58.343
The Jagannath...!

00:11:58.594 --> 00:12:00.721
Ades' 3rd Fleet?!

00:12:00.971 --> 00:12:05.267
Sky Pirate floating docks and multiple
small vessels ahead! Distance, 2,000!

00:12:09.229 --> 00:12:10.856
It's about time.

00:12:18.155 --> 00:12:20.365
This is the Ades fleet.

00:12:20.616 --> 00:12:24.161
You will now pay the price
for your unrelenting defiance

00:12:24.411 --> 00:12:26.955
and acts of depredation.

00:12:28.457 --> 00:12:30.167
Prepare for counter-air combat!

00:12:30.417 --> 00:12:33.879
Obliterate all who oppose the Augusta's cause!

00:12:34.129 --> 00:12:34.922
Yes, Sir!

00:12:35.172 --> 00:12:37.507
Gloria, Augusta!

00:12:37.758 --> 00:12:39.426
Activating rapid-fire control system!

00:12:39.676 --> 00:12:43.388
Actuating coupled anti-aircraft guns #1 and #2!

00:12:56.735 --> 00:12:59.446
I should've seen this coming...!

00:13:02.491 --> 00:13:03.951
No!

00:13:08.288 --> 00:13:10.457
--We've been set up!
--We can't go upward!

00:13:10.707 --> 00:13:13.001
--There's nowhere to run!
--Damn!

00:13:15.128 --> 00:13:19.132
We've leapt right into the wolf's fangs?!

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:24.388
What now?! How do we get outta here, Gisey?!

00:13:24.638 --> 00:13:26.056
Just a second...!

00:13:26.306 --> 00:13:32.229
<i>I only see the 3rd Fleet's Jagannath
and Field Squadrons #1 through #4.</i>

00:13:32.479 --> 00:13:35.065
<i>This isn't the entire main force...</i>

00:13:35.315 --> 00:13:37.693
<i>These are all long-distance ships-of-the-line.</i>

00:13:37.943 --> 00:13:40.904
<i>They're meant for direct and decisive
fleet-against-fleet battles.</i>

00:13:41.154 --> 00:13:41.822
Which means...!

00:13:42.072 --> 00:13:45.117
Their lower turrets can't keep up with the Vespa!

00:13:45.367 --> 00:13:48.745
Slip under the fleet and skim along
the water to get through the canyon!

00:13:48.996 --> 00:13:50.497
Got it!

00:13:56.294 --> 00:13:59.923
Actuate lower anti-aircraft guns and open fire!

00:14:00.173 --> 00:14:02.342
Open fire!

00:14:17.691 --> 00:14:19.359
They have guns below, too?!

00:14:24.698 --> 00:14:26.616
They're mere Sky Pirates.

00:14:26.867 --> 00:14:30.245
They don't have the speed
of Glacies' rocket fighters.

00:14:30.495 --> 00:14:34.916
This isn't enough of a fight to provide
useful data for our new weapon.

00:14:35.167 --> 00:14:38.545
Creche. There is no such thing
as a meaningless mission.

00:14:38.795 --> 00:14:41.089
I apologize. I was out of line.

00:14:43.925 --> 00:14:45.469
(iiseY!

00:15:10.452 --> 00:15:12.662
Purge the repair deck! Quickly!

00:15:12.913 --> 00:15:14.372
Atamora!

00:15:14.623 --> 00:15:16.708
Dad... Dad?!

00:15:16.958 --> 00:15:20.879
--No! Dad! No!
--Gisey! Calm down!

00:15:21.129 --> 00:15:24.883
Only the repair deck's been hit!
It's not enough to take the ship down!

00:15:25.133 --> 00:15:25.926
But...!

00:15:26.176 --> 00:15:30.972
Atamora would never fall that easily.
You know that more than anyone!

00:15:33.266 --> 00:15:36.019
<i>There's gotta be something we can do!</i>

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:44.069
Grand Birds...

00:15:49.783 --> 00:15:51.326
That's it!

00:15:52.619 --> 00:15:54.329
Fam! The wind there is too strong!

00:15:54.579 --> 00:15:58.750
It's okay! The Grand Birds
have shown us the way!

00:16:09.761 --> 00:16:11.972
The current changes...

00:16:12.222 --> 00:16:14.850
...for just a moment after the
glaciers come crashing down!

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.434
It's impossible, Fam!

00:16:16.685 --> 00:16:19.479
The Grand Birds made it through!
It's all about timing!

00:16:19.729 --> 00:16:23.483
There's gotta be at least one
moment when we can get through!

00:16:23.733 --> 00:16:26.111
It's already too late
by the time the birds fly off!

00:16:26.361 --> 00:16:29.531
We'd need to cause a shockwave
to change the current ourselves...!

00:16:34.619 --> 00:16:36.163
Oh!

00:16:40.792 --> 00:16:43.128
Those are Pam's signal flares!

00:16:43.378 --> 00:16:45.130
"Attract their fire"?!

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:47.215
That Birdbrain!

00:16:47.465 --> 00:16:50.760
They've been blasting at us
this entire time, you know!

00:16:52.596 --> 00:16:54.389
Signal from Pam's ship!

00:16:54.639 --> 00:17:00.270
"Follow my lead into the canyon
while attracting the 3rd Fleet's fire!"

00:17:07.527 --> 00:17:08.778
Lend 'em a hand!

00:17:09.029 --> 00:17:11.114
Good tailwinds!

00:17:12.866 --> 00:17:14.826
Those prodigal girls...

00:17:15.869 --> 00:17:19.748
The Sky Pirates are all
withdrawing into the canyon!

00:17:19.998 --> 00:17:23.418
Our data collection is nearly complete.

00:17:23.668 --> 00:17:25.795
It's time to finish them off.

00:17:35.388 --> 00:17:36.973
Fire main cannons!

00:17:39.893 --> 00:17:41.394
Now!

00:18:01.122 --> 00:18:03.041
A gustnado is forming!

00:18:10.382 --> 00:18:13.343
Engines at maximum! Use auxiliary circuits!

00:18:18.682 --> 00:18:22.269
What are you doing?! Go after the Sky Pirates!

00:18:22.519 --> 00:18:23.979
B-But, Sir...!

00:18:24.229 --> 00:18:27.899
It's impossible to get a fix on
them amid all these Grand Birds!

00:18:54.301 --> 00:18:55.802
Milady!

00:18:57.887 --> 00:18:59.973
Are you doing well?

00:19:00.223 --> 00:19:04.602
Of course. We surviving members of Chaos
have always been strong in that regard.

00:19:04.853 --> 00:19:09.733
Umm, Milady? About this
recent purging of returnees...

00:19:09.983 --> 00:19:11.985
You idiot! Don't put her on the spot!

00:19:12.235 --> 00:19:14.029
Put yourself in her shoes!

00:19:14.279 --> 00:19:16.072
S-Sorry...

00:19:16.323 --> 00:19:20.660
I don't blame you for feeling uneasy.
There's no need for worry, however.

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:25.582
The Augusta knows the people
of Chaos are loyal to her.

00:19:25.832 --> 00:19:27.876
Oh, right! Of course!

00:19:28.126 --> 00:19:30.962
--Duh! Anyone coulda told you that!
--Yeah!

00:19:31.212 --> 00:19:33.840
You're such a scaredy-cat, you know that?

00:19:45.977 --> 00:19:49.230
--They really did a number on us...
--Yeah.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:54.319
What happens now?

00:19:54.569 --> 00:19:59.574
What do you mean? We hunt
Skyfish to survive, same as always!

00:19:59.824 --> 00:20:03.453
But even that's starting to look grim...

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.629
--Time to leave.
--All that for nothing...

00:20:18.802 --> 00:20:20.428
Fam. We should go, too...

00:20:20.678 --> 00:20:23.640
Sorry, Gisey. Type this up for me.

00:20:26.267 --> 00:20:29.020
You sure about letting 'em go?

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:33.400
Sky Pirates pride themselves
in keeping promises.

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:39.531
<i>I'm sorry for acting selfishly.
But indulge me for just a little longer.</i>

00:20:39.781 --> 00:20:44.202
<i>We can't come home just yet. Millia is waiting.</i>

00:20:49.457 --> 00:20:54.379
Don't be so glum! We'll just
find new prey to go after!

00:20:55.839 --> 00:21:00.427
It's all thanks to you that we made it out alive.

00:21:02.554 --> 00:21:06.224
With the two of us together, we'll be just fine!

00:21:06.474 --> 00:21:08.143
Fam...

00:21:13.481 --> 00:21:16.401
Vespa approaching. It's Fam.

00:21:16.651 --> 00:21:19.779
Pam's ship has returned. Open hangar hatch.

00:21:20.029 --> 00:21:21.489
I'll go greet them!

00:21:21.739 --> 00:21:24.242
Yes, Princess!

00:21:31.332 --> 00:21:35.211
Multiple engine acoustics from
behind Fam's ship! Distance, 05!

00:21:57.609 --> 00:21:59.861
--They tailed us?!
--The Anshar?!

00:22:04.449 --> 00:22:06.409
Why didn't we detect them?!

00:22:09.078 --> 00:22:13.500
Communication signal from Admiral Sadri,
Commandant of the 1st Fleet!

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:15.752
What does he say?!

00:22:16.002 --> 00:22:18.338
"Hand over Princess Millia..."

00:22:18.588 --> 00:22:20.423
"...or else..."

00:22:20.673 --> 00:22:23.843
"...we will sink your ship."

00:22:31.017 --> 00:22:36.481
<i>How high are the skies,</i>

00:22:36.731 --> 00:22:42.529
<i>how strong are the winds,</i>

00:22:42.779 --> 00:22:48.368
<i>how clear are the waters</i>

00:22:48.618 --> 00:22:55.667
<i>you hold in your heart?</i>

00:22:56.876 --> 00:23:08.346
<i>One day I want to be the palm
of your hand and catch your tears</i>

00:23:08.596 --> 00:23:20.441
<i>I want us to share the
same sorrows, the same air</i>

00:23:20.692 --> 00:23:26.281
<i>I'll point the prow of this departing ship</i>

00:23:26.531 --> 00:23:35.081
<i>Right your way with no hesitation</i>

00:23:35.331 --> 00:23:41.045
<i>Let's raise the mast in this sea of wind</i>

00:23:41.296 --> 00:23:46.843
<i>And set sail on these waves of clouds</i>

00:23:47.093 --> 00:23:52.599
<i>With the faraway stars for a compass</i>

00:23:52.849 --> 00:24:00.523
<i>I'll head beyond the horizon with you</i>

00:24:03.443 --> 00:24:04.736
<i>--Oh, Teddy.
--Princess Millia!</i>

00:24:04.986 --> 00:24:06.738
<i>Are you organizing the storeroom
with the maintenance crew?</i>

00:24:06.988 --> 00:24:10.533
<i>No, I acquired it myself! As of today,</i>

00:24:10.783 --> 00:24:14.120
<i>it's the office of the Turan refugee
government and your own private study!</i>

00:24:14.370 --> 00:24:18.583
<i>For as much as Ignace likes to gamble,
he's certainly no good at it!</i>

00:24:18.833 --> 00:24:20.335
<i>Teddy... You...?</i>

00:24:20.585 --> 00:24:24.756
<i>I'm going to keep this up and expand
our territory all throughout the Silvius!</i>

00:24:25.006 --> 00:24:26.883
<i>Just you wait and see, Princess Millia!</i>

00:24:27.133 --> 00:24:29.010
Do <i>I</i> really want to...?
